      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Electromagnetically induced transparency revealed striking quantum control of light and matter, opening a broad field of coherent optical phenomena.",
        "attribution": "Harris provided seminal conceptual and experimental leadership; Hau and Imamoglu made distinctive landmark advances in slow light and coherent light control.",
        "maturity": "The effects are robust, extensively reproduced, and foundational across atomic physics and quantum optics.",
